          },
          "text": "Typhoon Ragasa update: @AaronRigsbyOSC and myself successfully made a very last second move to the small town of Ivana, Philippines on Batan Island. A 16KM scooter ride in the dark along a very landslide prone area. There is no turning back to Basco until this storm passes. The power has gone out but still have cell signal. No clue when that will fail but the winds are picking up significantly. We are currently under a Signal 4 advisory for extreme damage to critical infrastructure and vegetation. \n\nTyphoon Ragasa has expanded its eye into a giant “truck tire” which means the wind field is expanding well beyond the eye. We are only hours away from violent CAT4-5 winds hitting our location. I will update as the day goes on and service allows. \n\n#typhoon #Ragasa #batanisland #Philippines"
        },
